        "heading": "Press",
        "intro": "<p>Everything you need to write about us, in one place. Images are free to use editorially with a credit. If you need something that isn't here, just ask—we're two blokes and an inbox, so you'll get a real reply.</p>",
        "press_email": "hello@whiskyblender.com",
        "boiler_heading": "The short version",
        "boilerplate": "<p>Whisky Blender lets anyone blend, name and label their own bottle of Scotch. Founded in Bothwell, Scotland in 2011 by two friends, Andy and Drew, it hand-selects well-aged casks and hands the blending over to the customer—who then names the result and puts it on the label. Every bottle is filled and bottled in Scotland. Its online blending lab launched in June 2026 and has produced more than 500 one-of-a-kind whiskies in its first eight weeks: bottles for weddings, for birthdays, for folk who just fancied one with their own name on it.</p>",
        "facts_heading": "Fast facts",
